  "title": "23 September 1968: Recording: Happiness Is A Warm Gun",
  "date": "1968-09-23",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road<br>\nProducer: Chris Thomas<br>\nEngineer: Ken Scott</p><p>One of the <a href=\"/albums/the-beatles-white-album/\">White Album</a>’s highlights, <a href=\"/songs/happiness-is-a-warm-gun/\">‘Happiness Is A Warm Gun’</a>, had its first recording session on this evening. <span id=\"more-6612\"></span></p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1968/09/23/recording-happiness-is-a-warm-gun/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-6612 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-john-lennon/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"140\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon-140x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"White Album portrait: John Lennon\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon-140x200.jpg 140w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon-405x580.jpg 405w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon-670x960.jpg 670w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon-768x1101.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon-1071x1536.jpg 1071w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon.jpg 1174w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 140px) 100vw, 140px\" data-attachment-id=\"23421\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-john-lennon/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1174,1683\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"White Album portrait: John Lennon\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-john-lennon-670x960.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"139\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney-139x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"White Album portrait: Paul McCartney\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney-139x200.jpg 139w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney-404x580.jpg 404w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney-669x960.jpg 669w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney-768x1103.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney-1070x1536.jpg 1070w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney.jpg 1172w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 139px) 100vw, 139px\" data-attachment-id=\"23422\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1172,1683\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"White Album portrait: Paul McCartney\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-paul-mccartney-669x960.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-george-harrison/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzkiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTM5IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"139\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison-139x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"White Album portrait: George Harrison\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison-139x200.jpg 139w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison-404x580.jpg 404w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison-669x960.jpg 669w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison-768x1103.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison-1070x1536.jpg 1070w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison.jpg 1182w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 139px) 100vw, 139px\" data-attachment-id=\"23420\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-george-harrison/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1182,1697\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"White Album portrait: George Harrison\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-george-harrison-669x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzkiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTM5IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"139\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr-139x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"White Album portrait: Ringo Starr\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr-139x200.jpg 139w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr-404x580.jpg 404w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr-669x960.jpg 669w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr-768x1103.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr-1070x1536.jpg 1070w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr.jpg 1175w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 139px) 100vw, 139px\" data-attachment-id=\"23423\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1175,1687\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"White Album portrait: Ringo Starr\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/white-album-portrait-ringo-starr-669x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The session took place from 7pm-3am. The Beatles recorded 45 takes of the song, which had the working title ‘Happiness Is A Warm Gun In Your Hand’. <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> played electric guitar and sang a guide vocal, <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> was on another electric guitar, <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> played bass, and <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a> was on drums.</p><p>The song’s various changes in tempo and time signature resulting in a number of breakdowns. The <a href=\"/1968/09/24/recording-happiness-is-a-warm-gun-2/\">following evening</a> they taped another 25 attempts, which eventually resulted in a usable backing track.</p><figure id=\"attachment_108810\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-108810\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-108810\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iOTU5IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDk1OSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"108810\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"834,1000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Lyrics for Happiness Is A Warm Gun, transcribed by Mal Evans\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"<p>Lyrics for Happiness Is A Warm Gun, transcribed by Mal Evans</p>\n\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01-801x960.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01-801x960.jpg\" alt=\"Lyrics for Happiness Is A Warm Gun, transcribed by Mal Evans\" width=\"800\" height=\"959\" class=\"size-large wp-image-108810\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01-801x960.jpg 801w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01-484x580.jpg 484w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01-167x200.jpg 167w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01-768x921.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-happiness-is-a-warm-gun_01.jpg 834w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-108810\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lyrics for Happiness Is A Warm Gun, transcribed by Mal Evans</figcaption></figure>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 23 June 2023</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2025: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2025/09/23/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-yaamava-theater-highland-2/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Yaamava’ Theater, Highland</a></li><li>2023: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2023/09/23/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-fox-theatre-st-louis-4/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Fox Theatre, St Louis</a></li><li>2022: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2022/09/23/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-hartford-healthcare-amphitheater-bridgeport/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Hartford HealthCare Amphitheater, Bridgeport</a></li><li>2018: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/09/23/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-ordway-center-performing-arts-saint-paul/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Ordway Center for the Performing Arts, Saint Paul</a></li><li>2017: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2017/09/23/paul-mccartney-live-carrier-dome-syracuse/\">Paul McCartney live: Carrier Dome, Syracuse</a></li><li>2013: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2013/09/23/paul-mccartney-live-el-capitan-outdoor-stage-jimmy-kimmel-los-angeles/\">Paul McCartney live: El Capitan Outdoor Stage, Los Angeles (Jimmy Kimmel Live)</a></li><li>2005: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2005/09/23/paul-mccartney-live-wells-fargo-center-philadelphia-3/\">Paul McCartney live: Wachovia Center, Philadelphia</a></li><li>2003: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2003/09/23/paul-mccartney-live-adopt-a-minefield-gala-los-angeles-3/\">Paul McCartney live: Adopt-A-Minefield Gala, Los Angeles</a></li><li>2002: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2002/09/23/paul-mccartney-live-xcel-energy-center-saint-paul/\">Pau